cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LayoutTranslateBench"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  LayoutTranslateBench (LTB) is a public benchmark for document translation
  with layout preservation. Submissions are scored on translation quality
  (chrF), layout fidelity (IoU), and reading-order preservation (Kendall tau),
  combined into a single composite score LTB-100.
authors:
  - name: "LayoutTranslateBench Contributors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-18"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - document-ai
  - translation
  - localization
  - layout-preservation
  - ocr
  - leaderboard
repository-code: "https://github.com/<org>/document-parser"
url: "https://github.com/<org>/document-parser"
preferred-citation:
